<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine cash Jan wheat firms.</title>
<headline>Argentine cash Jan wheat firms.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine January cash wheat prices firmed in good volume on Buenos Aires Cereals Exchange, but dealers were braced for prices to drop as sellers continue appearing on the market.</p>
<p>Cash maize prices bucked up on export pressure. Soybean and sunflower continued to attract buying interest, although volume was modest.</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom, +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
